<ans># Star Health and Allied Insurance Ltd — H1FY27 Financial Data Pull

<span style="background:#FFFBEB;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;color:#F59E0B">STATUS: NOT YET PUBLISHED</span>

## Finding

Based on a direct review of the Star Health investor financial-information page and all associated IRDAI public-disclosure (NL-return) and investor-presentation materials, <span style="color:#F59E0B;font-weight:600">Star Health and Allied Insurance Company Ltd has not yet released its H1 FY27 (half-year ended 30 September 2026) financial results as of the reference date of 26 October 2026.</span>

<div style="border-left:4px solid #F59E0B;background:#FFFBEB;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:4px;">
The Board meeting to approve the Q2/H1 FY27 unaudited results is scheduled for <b>27 October 2026</b>, with the earnings call on <b>28 October 2026</b> — both falling <i>after</i> the current reference date. Consequently, no statutory NL-1/NL-2 disclosures, balance sheet, or investor deck covering the six months ended 30 September 2026 exist yet on the company's site or the IRDAI portal.
</div>

### Supporting Evidence
- *"16 Oct – Star Health and Allied Insurance Company Limited has informed about the Schedule of Q2 & H1 FY2027 Earnings call dated October 28, 2026."* <doc_source>step3web1</doc_source>
- *"25 Sep – Board meets on October 27, 2026 to approve Q2 and half-year FY27 unaudited results."* <doc_source>step3web1</doc_source>
- The Star Health investor financial-information page <doc_source>step1</doc_source> and all website/IRDAI searches currently surface only **Q1 FY27** (quarter ended 30 June 2026), **FY26 full-year/Q4 FY26**, and **Q3 FY26** materials — no H1FY27 (6-month) statutory disclosure or investor deck has been filed.

Per the task's own rule — *leave value blank if a figure is genuinely not published* — and the explicit prohibition against substituting a single standalone quarter for a half-year cumulative figure, none of the requested H1FY27 line items can be populated at this time.

